<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Work — Andreas Andreou</title><meta name="description" content="Commercial, regulatory and strategic work across Greece, Cyprus and public-sector markets."><link rel="icon" href="assets/favicon.svg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"></head><body><header class="site-header wrap"><a class="wordmark" href="/">Andreas Andreou</a><nav class="nav"><a href="/bio">Bio</a><a href="/work">Work</a><a href="/public-contribution">Public life</a><a href="https://www.procura.gr/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Procura ↗</a><a href="/#ideas">Ideas</a></nav><a class="contact" href="/#contact">Contact</a></header><main><section class="section wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Work</span><h2>Projects and decisions between markets, institutions and technology.</h2><p>My work is shaped by three perspectives: commercial practice, public responsibility and the ambition to build systems that work in the real world.</p></section><section class="section wrap"><div class="list"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Commercial and regulatory practice</h3><p>At Frangos Law, I help businesses, investors and international clients with market entry, commercial, corporate, real estate, investment and regulatory matters across Greece and Cyprus.</p></div><b>↗</b></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Public-sector markets and procurement</h3><p>Through Procura and ongoing research, I focus on the space between a public need and a market solution: the information, incentives and institutional context that shape purchasing decisions. My public-sector experience keeps the work grounded in delivery, not only theory.</p></div><b>↗</b></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Strategic projects that need to become real</h3><p>I connect legal analysis, stakeholder understanding and practical coordination where a project involves multiple decision-makers, public bodies or regulated environments.</p></div><b>↗</b></article></div></section><section class="section wrap split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Useful at the point of change</span></div><div><h2>Good judgment travels.</h2><p>Clients usually need more than an answer. They need to understand the environment around the answer, identify the people who can move it forward and make the next decision with confidence.</p><a class="button" href="mailto:andreoulegal@gmail.com">Discuss a project ↗</a></div></section></main><footer class="footer wrap"><div><strong>Andreas Andreou</strong><small>Athens, Greece</small></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="mailto:andreoulegal@gmail.com">Email</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andreoulegal" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 Andreas Andreou</span><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer></body></html>
